      "filePath": "app/api/mentor/route.ts",
      "summary": "Main AI mentor interaction endpoint (1466 lines). Socratic teaching engine with 4-layer rate-limit defense (per-user limiting, global cache, request coalescing, API key pool). Implements a 6-stage teaching pipeline (Explore, Strategize, Implement, Debug, Stuck, Reflect) with learning rung detection, tone analysis, solution-request gating, output sanitization, conversation memory, and graceful AI failure fallback. Supports Groq, OpenRouter, OpenAI, Google, and Ollama providers with automatic key rotation.",
